---
title: Which health check a lane runs
---
flowchart TD
    N([Native lane]) --> X{x-hack-http declared?}
    X -->|yes| D[Declared route probe]
    X -->|no| R{Routed? caddy and reverse_proxy}
    R -->|yes| K{healthcheck key}
    K -->|absent| I[Inferred GET / probe]
    K -->|enabled test| IR[Inferred probe replaces check<br/>listed as uneven]
    K -->|disabled or no test| F[Native refuses]
    R -->|no| T{test in Compose file?}
    C([Compose lane]) --> T
    T -->|yes| E[Engine command check]
    T -->|disabled| O[No check]
    T -->|no test| U[Image's own check<br/>listed as unknown]
    class D,I,E ok
    class IR,U wait
    class F fail
    class O idle
    class N,C live
